graph LR
  User((User))
  subgraph Client["Client Tier — Browser Extension"]
    Popup[/popup.html (UI)/]
    Background[/background.js (Service Worker)/]
    Content[/content.js (Page Script)/]
  end
  Backend[/backend/server.js (API)/]
  subgraph RAG["RAG / Indexing Tier"]
    QueryPy[query.py]
    Ingest[ingest.py]
    VectorDB((Vector DB\nchroma.sqlite3))
  end
  LLM((LLM / Embedding Provider))

  User -->|Search Query| Popup
  Popup -->|User action| Background
  Background -->|POST /search (q)| Backend
  Backend -->|invoke search| QueryPy
  QueryPy -->|vector search (ids + scores)| VectorDB
  QueryPy -->|embed / complete| LLM
  QueryPy -->|candidate contexts (passages)| Backend
  Backend -->|JSON response (results)| Background
  Background -->|display| Popup
  Ingest -->|create embeddings → write| VectorDB
  Ingest -->|uses| LLM
